# Modelling a SaaS workspace

This example models a multi-tenant SaaS product. Each workspace has projects, and projects have
documents:

```
/workspaces/<workspace>                              workspace-wide grants
/workspaces/<workspace>/projects/<project>           project-level grants
/workspaces/<workspace>/projects/<project>/docs/<id> documents inherit both
```

It defines a set of permissions, builds roles from them, models teams as groups, and grants roles to
the groups on the workspace, so that every project and document inherits them. A wildcard grant
(`/projects/_/help-centre`) covers the help-centre of every project. Finally, `permio_check` data
sources and a `check` block assert the intended policy.

